{
  "Scenes.Forest.Aiko.Description": "Aiko stands before you, a little over 5'4 tall. She has a head of short silver-blond hair that ends above her shoulders, parted by two large, furry fox ears. {0} luxurious fox tails sway behind her, the silky fur shimmering as they move. She wears a set of revealing blue and white robes, neatly pressed and hung off her features with care, her D-cup breasts bound by a cloth chest wrap that is just a little too tight. She sports a number of red \"tattoos\" adorning her face and body; the most prominent of which are the spiral-shaped patterns on her palms and buttocks, and a stylized lotus flower on her lower back. She wields a longbow almost as tall as she is that she can summon and dismiss with a snap of her fingers, and stares you down with a determined fire in her glittering blue eyes."
  "Scenes.Forest.Aiko.DescriptionCorrupted": "Aiko stands before you, a little over 5'4 tall. She has a head of short, unkempt silver-blond hair that ends above her shoulders, parted by two large, furry fox ears. {0} fox tails sway behind her, their fur shaggy and matted down. She wears a set of ragged, bloodied robes that show a lot of skin, her D-cup breasts haphazardly bound by a set of bandages in dire need of changing, and you can smell sex and violence on her even from here. She sports a number of red \"tattoos\" adorning her face and body; the most prominent of which are the spiral-shaped patterns on her palms and buttocks, and a stylized lotus flower on her lower back. She is wielding an over-sized bill-hook hatchet that she can summon and dismiss with a snap of her fingers, and stares you down with a maniacal fire in her crazed blue eyes."
  "Scenes.Forest.Aiko.Name": "Aiko"
  "Scenes.Forest.Akbal.Description": "Tensed and poised, the tan black-spotted jaguar seems a hair-trigger away from a ferocious strike at any moment. His emerald eyes burn with determination and zeal. This beast is not going to take it easy; this is not just another day fruitlessly fighting off the many critters that wander clueless into his domain, this is his mission. He doesn't need to say a word with his telepathy to make this clear."
  "Scenes.Forest.Akbal.DescriptionUnsealed": "Akbal stands nearly 8 feet tall, staring {0}at you with those familiar emerald eyes. His flesh is a deep and dark red, with well-defined muscles. His wings extend out several feet, impressively tall and wide just as he himself is. His face is haughty and self-assured, cleanly shaved, and topped with several feet of silky-smooth black hair and two long demonic horns. He fancies himself a god, and certainly looks like the type who would think such a thing. His arms are tattooed with emerald-glowing horizontal lines, relative to a resting angle, three on each arm. His fingers are all tipped with dark, off-white, claw-like nails. Snaking out behind him is a thick and pointed demonic tail. His only clothing is an animal-hide loin cloth, perhaps a stylistic choice from Fera."
  "Scenes.Forest.Akbal.Name": "Akbal"
  "Scenes.Forest.BeeGirl.Description": "A bee-girl buzzes around you, filling the air with intoxicatingly sweet scents and a buzz that gets inside your head. She has a humanoid face with small antennae, black chitin on her arms and legs that looks like shiny gloves and boots, sizable breasts, and a swollen abdomen tipped with a gleaming stinger."
  "Scenes.Forest.BeeGirl.Name": "bee-girl"
  "Scenes.Forest.Discover.ForestDiscovered": "[pg]<b>You have discovered the Forest!</b>"
  "Scenes.Forest.Discover.LongWalk": "You walk for quite some time, roaming the hard-packed and pink-tinged earth of the demon-realm. Rust-red rocks speckle the wasteland, as barren and lifeless as anywhere else you've been. A cool breeze suddenly brushes against your face, as if gracing you with its presence. You turn towards it and are confronted by the lush foliage of a very old looking forest. You smile as the plants look fairly familiar and non-threatening. Unbidden, you remember your decision to test the properties of this place, and think of your campsite as you walk forward. Reality seems to shift and blur, making you dizzy, but after a few minutes you're back, and sure you'll be able to return to the forest with similar speed."
  "Scenes.Forest.Dullahan.Description": "Before you stands a female knight. She looks mostly human, aside from her skin, which is pale blue, and eyes, which are black, with golden pupils. Her neat hair is very long, reaching up to her thighs. She wears what amounts to an armored corset; her breasts are barely covered by tight leather. While her forearm, abdomen and calves are covered in black steel plates, she's wearing thigh-highs and a plain white skirt that barely covers her legs. Over her armor, she wears a needlessly long cloak that wraps around her neck like a scarf. She has a cold but determined look to her, and her stance shows she has fencing experience."
  "Scenes.Forest.Dullahan.Name": "Dullahan"
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpLoss.HuffingAdrenaline": "Huffing from the adrenaline of the fight, the imp takes a moment to recollect himself. He stiffens up suddenly; looking back, he realizes his prey has most certainly escaped at some point."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpLoss.ImpLeaps": "[pg]As the imp leaps in an effort to grab her, she flies past him. The demon gives chase, but the faerie appears capable of staying just far enough that he has hope to succeed but yet still beyond his grasp. The two flutter and scramble off further into the woods. Whether or not she'll escape completely or get cornered again is unknown, but at least you can get home relatively unscathed."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpLoss.SwearVengeance": "[pg][say:Y-you... I chased that bitch for [b:so long!] I swear, I will [b:end you!]] he screeches. As he stomps forward, a faerie flutters around and catches his eye. His face lights up in a mix of further rage and renewed excitement as he sees his target has not yet gone too far."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpLoss.TurnsAttention": "[pg]The fae turns her attention to you. [say:Thank you for trying to save me! I don't let bad things happen to good people either!] she yells, pushing the limits of her puny lungs to be heard."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpWon.NoTangibleReward": "[pg]There may not be a tangible reward for saving the faerie, but it does give you some sense of accomplishment for the good deed."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpWon.SnatchesToken": "The imp falls, and you make haste to snatch the meager gems he may have."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpWon.SwoopsFace": "[pg]Swooping into your face with no warning, the victim he was attacking hovers inches in front of you. Although completely nude, she doesn't appear bashful about it, but instead has a very bright smile on her face."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieImpWon.ThankYouScreams": "[pg][say:Thank you! Thank you thank you thank you!] she screams in delight, shaking her arms up and down as she does so to burn off more of the excess excitement. She jolts forward and plants a tiny kiss on your [face] before fluttering off. Waving back at you, she says [say:I'm happy you saved me! Marae bless you!]"
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpLeaveOneoff.HarshPlace": "Such a harsh place, but this time it's not your problem. As you turn to leave, the desperate screams of the smaller creature remind you how hostile this world is."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpOneoff.AlwaysClose": "[pg][say:[b:Always] this damn close to catching you tiny little whores!] yells the seething little demon. While hard to make out, you hear pitched screams from within the hole, likely the would-be victim here. Should you intervene?"
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpOneoff.ImpClings": "[pg]Off beyond some foliage is an imp clinging to a tree, furiously trying to dig something out of a hole in the trunk. He seems outstandingly frustrated."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpOneoff.LeastClutteredPath": "As you wander the least-cluttered path you can find, an angry snarling catches your attention. On reflex, you lower yourself in a defensive position as you seek the source. Scratching noises accompany the throaty growls, and all the movement catches your eye at last."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchNextOneoff.FaeSqueaks": "[pg]The fae lets out many tiny squeaks as she attempts to scream and resist. This noise is quelled as the imp tightens his grip, threatening her to cooperate. You can't see much from your position, but she does calm down. The imp lets out a sigh of relief and enjoyment as he begins masturbating faster. His pace picks up at an alarming rate, and you wonder if the friction is a danger to the faerie's life."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchNextOneoff.HeavingSigh": "[pg]Heaving a long sigh, the imp looks down at the spattered creature in his hand. [say:Now do you still want to escape?] he asks with a smug look on his face. Delirious murmurs can be heard from the faerie, unclear if it'd be any more understandable up close. [say:Good,] says the imp, storing his victim in a small sack. He walks off into the woods in a much cheerier mood."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchNextOneoff.UnveilsCock": "The imp unveils his cock from his loincloth. Its massive and girthy red flesh is several times the size of the faerie, and for a moment you wonder if he intends to attempt insertion. Fortunately for the faerie, he only slaps her nude body against the shaft and begins rubbing her on it. It is still likely an unpleasant experience, admittedly."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchNextOneoff.WorksUpFull": "[pg]Groaning loudly, the imp works up to full speed and starts to ejaculate. At the apex of his orgasm, he pulls the faerie up to the head of his spasming cock, firing away the bulk of his cum directly against her body. By the time he finishes, she's completely soaked in his jism."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchOneoff.SwipesFae": "[pg]The imp swipes at the fae, gripping her tightly in his hand. [say:Now I've got you! Gods, you're dumb.]"
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchOneoff.SwipesHole": "[pg]The imp swipes wildly into the hole before taking a rest. He wipes some sweat from his brow, then peers inside the tree trunk. [say:Tell you what, come on out peacefully and we'll compromise. Make me cum and you can leave. I'll pull away when I finish, you won't even need to let yourself get drenched. Just come on out!]"
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchOneoff.UnheardResponse": "[pg]While you cannot hear the response, you eventually see a small faerie crawling sheepishly out. With her vibrant rose-red hair and transparent scarlet wings, she has quite the striking appearance. Unless she keeps herself around similarly colored flowers, you bet most imps would take notice around the greens and browns of the forest."
  "Scenes.Forest.FaerieXImpWatchOneoff.WatchNature": "Deciding it may be better to watch nature unfold, you settle in at your decent vantage point."
  "Scenes.Forest.FindChitin.FindsCarapace": "You find a large piece of insectile carapace obscured in the ferns to your left. It's mostly black with a thin border of bright yellow along the outer edge. There's still a fair portion of yellow fuzz clinging to the chitinous shard. "
  "Scenes.Forest.FindChitin.StrongFlexible": "It feels strong and flexible - maybe someone can make something of it. "
  "Scenes.Forest.FindHPill.FindsPill": "You find a pill stamped with the letter 'H' discarded on the ground. "
  "Scenes.Forest.FindTruffle.SpotsTruffle": "You spot something unusual. Taking a closer look, it's definitely a truffle of some sort. "
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.DaydreamsDemons": "daydreaming about sex-demons with huge sexual attributes, and how you could please them."
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.IdlyToying": "idly toying with your {0} as you daydream about getting fucked by all kinds of monstrous cocks, from minotaurs' thick, smelly dongs to demons' towering, bumpy pleasure-rods."
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.PeacefulWalk": "You enjoy a peaceful walk in the woods, it gives you time to think."
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.StrokesAlternately": "stroking alternatively your [cocks] and your {0} as you daydream about fucking all kinds of women, from weeping tight virgins to lustful succubi with gaping, drooling fuck-holes, before, or while, getting fucked by various monstrous cocks, from minotaurs' thick, smelly dongs to demons' towering, bumpy pleasure-rods."
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.StrokesHalfErect": "stroking your half-erect [cocks] as you daydream about fucking all kinds of women, from weeping tight virgins to lustful succubi with gaping, drooling fuck-holes."
  "Scenes.Forest.ForestWalkFn.WandersKeep": "As you wander in the forest, you keep "
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitEat.NoMore": "[pg]Looking around briefly, you can find no more of the marvelous fruit. A shame, but it can hardly dent the good mood this snack has put you in."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitEat.TeethPress": "[pg]Your teeth press against the taut skin, breaking it after only a moment's resistance. The taste immediately hits you--sweet, though not so much that it becomes saccharine, with just a hint of sourness to balance it out. A torrent of juice floods your mouth, and you're unable to stop it from spilling down your chin and onto the ground, but it hardly matters. Chewing the flesh for a moment, you find it to be agreeably tender, but not mushy, making for an excellent eating experience."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitEat.UnknownFruit": "Though you don't know exactly what this fruit is, it looks too good to pass up. You quickly pull it from its stem, surprised at the heft of it. It must be particularly juicy. The texture is smooth and glossy, and the flesh seems fairly firm. Turning it around in your hands, you can find no blemishes or indications that it might be unsafe to eat, so without further ado, you raise it to your mouth."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitEat.WolfedDown": "[pg]It's not long before you've wolfed down the whole thing, a small pit in the center the only part you can't devour. That was certainly satisfying, and you're already feeling reinvigorated, ready to face any troubles that may lie ahead. In fact, all of the aching caused by your earlier escapes has faded; your legs feel like they're fresh from camp."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitOneoff.CouldSample": "[pg]Perhaps you could sample it, if you're feeling brave..."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitOneoff.OddFruit": "[pg]An odd fruit at that; the color that surprised you is no less strange upon closer examination. A bright, lively yellow-orange banded with bold red stripes--it seems almost too vibrant for this place, as if it had come from somewhere else. Whatever the case, it seems to have grown here undisturbed, and it certainly looks ripe. A quick look around confirms that nothing else is here to challenge you for this fruit."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitOneoff.ThirdRoot": "You've just stumbled on your third root in the past ten minutes, and you're starting to really dislike this forest. It's wild, untamed, and filled with creatures that want nothing more than to rape you, and all of these annoyances seem to compound upon one another, swirling around in your head."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitOneoff.WrappedThought": "[pg]You're so wrapped up in this line of thought that you don't notice the startling shade of yellow in front of you until you almost bump into it. There's a momentary flash of worry at such an unusual color for the forest, but you're quickly calmed when you see that it's just a fruit."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitPass.MarethTaught": "Your time in Mareth has [if (days < 30) {already}] taught you well that the unknown is dangerous. You have no business eating random fruits you find lying around, no matter how succulent they might look."
  "Scenes.Forest.FruitPass.MovesPast": "[pg]You quickly move past the fruit and on through the forest. Your following exploration is dull and dreary, with nothing else of note happening until, with aching limbs and dampened spirit, you think of camp, and it soon appears before you."
  "Scenes.Forest.Kitsune.Description": "A kitsune stands in front of you, about five and a half feet tall. She has a head of {0} hair. She appears mostly human, except for a pair of large, furry ears poking through her hair and six luxurious silky tails swaying in the air behind her. Her robes are revealing but comfortable-looking, hugging her voluptuous curves and exposing large swaths of tattooed skin. A layer of ornate tattoos covers patches of her exposed flesh, accentuating her feminine curves nicely, and each movement brings a pleasant jiggle from her plump backside and large breasts."
  "Scenes.Forest.Kitsune.Name": "kitsune"
  "Scenes.Forest.MarbleVsImp.KicksImp": "[pg]She goes up to the imp, and kicks it once. Satisfied that the creature isn't moving, she turns around to face you and gives you a smile. [say: Sorry about that, but I prefer to take care of these buggers quickly. If they get the chance to call on their friends, they can actually become a nuisance.] She disappears back into the foliage briefly before reappearing holding two large pile of logs under her arms, with a fire axe and her hammer strapped to her back. [say: I'm gathering firewood for the farm, as you can see; what brings you to the forest, sweetie?] You inform her that you're just exploring."
  "Scenes.Forest.MarbleVsImp.SuddenSight": "While you're moving through the trees, you suddenly hear yelling ahead, followed by a crash and a scream as an imp comes flying at high speed through the foliage and impacts a nearby tree. The small demon slowly slides down the tree before landing at the base, still. A moment later, a familiar-looking cow-girl steps through the bushes brandishing a huge two-handed hammer with an angry look on her face."
  "Scenes.Forest.MarbleVsImp.WistfulSigh": "[pg]She gives a wistful sigh. [say: I haven't really explored much since getting to the farm. Between the jobs Whitney gives me, keeping in practice with my hammer, milking to make sure I don't get too full, cooking, and beauty sleep, I don't get a lot of free time to do much else.] She sighs again. [say: Well, I need to get this back, so I'll see you later!]"
  "Scenes.Forest.Placeholder": "TODO: {0} has not been implemented yet."
  "Scenes.Forest.Tamani.Name": "Tamani"
  "Scenes.Forest.TamanisDaughters.Description": "A large grouping of goblin girls has gathered around you, surrounding you on all sides. Most have varying shades of green skin, though a few have yellowish or light blue casts to their skin. All are barely clothed, exposing as much of their flesh as possible in order to excite a potential mate. Their hairstyles are as varied as their clothing and skin-tones, and the only things they seem to have in common are cute faces and curvy forms. It looks like they want something from you."
  "Scenes.Forest.TamanisDaughters.Name": "Tamani's daughters"
  "Scenes.Forest.Tamanisdaughters.Name": "Tamani's daughters"
  "Scenes.Forest.TentacleBeast.Description": "You see the massive, shambling form of the tentacle beast before you. Appearing as a large shrub, it shifts its bulbous mass and reveals a collection of thorny tendrils and cephalopodic limbs."
  "Scenes.Forest.TentacleBeastEncounterFn.TentacleKnowledge": "Using the knowledge contained in your 'Dangerous Plants' book, you determine a tentacle beast's lair is nearby, do you continue? If not you could return to camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Forest.TripOnARoot.TripsOnRoot": "You trip on an exposed root, scraping yourself somewhat, but otherwise the hour is uneventful."
}
